  "description": "LUQLOC crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21. Reported CIF formula moiety: C66 H70 Dy6 N8 O48,6(C2 H3 N1),4(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy1 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 7 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.732-3.879 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 103.20-112.06°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy6(L_S^1)2(μ3-OH)2(NO3)8(CH3OH)2]·6CH3CN·4CH3OH (paper EA C82H100Dy6N14O52; CCDC C66H70Dy6N8O48·6(C2H3N)·4(CH4O)). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 8 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 8 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
